  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: Oh, look at that, some friendly locals!
    - name: 5
      dialog: Surrender your ship, or die!
    - name: 19
      dialog: 'Correction: not friendly. Definitely not friendly.'
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 10
    requirementTarget: Junker/Sparrow (Tutorial)
    requirementQuantity: 3
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: Clearly, those ships didn't have the benefit of advanced combat AI.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Let's move on to Novus Prime before more of them show up.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 0
    requirementTarget: Sector 1/Fixed/Novus Prime
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 3
      dialog: Great work leading us here. This is the sector gateway, we'll establish
        camp and hold the position.
    - name: 3
      dialog: Dock with the mothership. We've got more to discuss.
    autoPilotMapping: 4
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 1
    requirementType: 150
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 3
      dialog: You can buy and sell items here as well as repair, upgrade, and redesign
        your ship.
    - name: 3
      dialog: This sector gateway will take us one step closer to Earth.
    - name: 3
      dialog: The Skeran forces in this sector hold the three keystones needed to
        power it though.
    - name: 3
      dialog: I'll start tracking them down. In the meantime, I have another task
        for you. When you undock I'll update your navigation.
    - name: 19
      dialog: You should edit the ship's design before undocking. Wouldn't want someone
        to mistake it for space junk.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
